msgstr ""
"Este comando define a aplicación que se desexa executar para que mostre o\n"
"enderezo postal dun contacto."

#. i18n: file: actions/contactactionssettings.kcfg:38
#. i18n: ectx: tooltip, entry (AddressCommand), group (Show Address Settings)
#: rc.cpp:41
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The following placeholders can be used in the command:\n"
"   %s: Street\n"
"   %r: Region\n"
"   %l: Location\n"
"   %z: Zip Code\n"
"   %c: Country ISO Code"
